                  "text": "ASME SB-861"
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "text": "ASME SB-861 | Standard Specification for Titanium and Titanium Alloy Seamless Pipe"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASME SB-861 is almost identical to ASTM B861 except for an editorial revision to paragraph 4.1.10. This specification covers all grades of Titanium and Titanium alloys and is also the standard specification for Titanium and Titanium seamless pipe. These products are intended for general corrosion resisting and elevated temperature service."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "The ASME SB-861 (ASTM B861) specifications includes reference documents, terminology, ordering information, manufacture, chemical requirements, dimensions of pipe, tensile requirements, tolerances and variations, surface finish, inspection and tests, packing and certification."
                }
              ]
            }
